            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.0.56

- Open configured routed preview addresses for detected checkouts and existing-session recovery, preserving page paths and queries.
- Match failure colors across avatar badges, sidebar alerts and the overview issue card.
- Expand and collapse issue information by clicking its full header, including the status icon, with smooth motion and Reduce Motion support.

Requires macOS 26 or later and Apple silicon. Versions through 1.0.52 require one manual installation to enable in-app updates.
]]></description>
